# KinCony KC868-A8v3 (docs/devices/kincony-kc868-a8v3.md). Pins, Ethernet, RTC and on-board IO come
# with the board option (menuconfig: Board). Applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults by the "a8v3"
# preset (CMakePresets.json):
#   export IDF_PRESET=a8v3; idf.py build flash monitor
CONFIG_CLU_BOARD_KINCONY_A8V3=y
